Custom emoji tapbacks for imsg (https://github.com/openclaw/imsg).
imsg is MIT licensed, Copyright (c) 2026 Peter Steinberger; see its LICENSE.

Lets `imsg tapback --emoji <emoji>` send and remove any single-emoji
tapback (Messages types 2006/3006), not just the six classic kinds. Made
against v0.15.9; applies cleanly to v0.15.10. Uno works without it: the six
classic tapbacks still go through, and Uno is told to use one of them.

Build and install: docs/install.md, "Custom emoji reactions (optional)".

